<title>USA: Matrix Capital says to buy Vintage Group.</title>
<headline>Matrix Capital says to buy Vintage Group.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Co. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matrix Capital Corp said on Monday that it has entered into a letter of intent to acquire The Vintage Group Inc</p>
<p>In a statement, Matrix said that the anticipated purchase price for the Texas-based Vintage subsidiaries, Sterling Trust Co and Vintage Financial Services Corp, is $11.25 million, which will be paid through the issuance of common stock of the company.</p>
</text>
